  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個附加元件適用於 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a>，可增強</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's</a> 結構中的戰利品：<br></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">MVS - Moog's Voyager Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mss-moogs-soaring-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">MSS - Moog's Soaring Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-end-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">MES - Moog's End Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mns-moogs-nether-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">MNS - Moog's Nether Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmv-moogs-missing-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMV - Moog's Missing Villages</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mtr-moogs-temples-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTR - Moog's Temples Reimagined</a></span></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mbs-moogs-bountiful-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MBS - Moog's Bountiful Structures</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmr-moogs-mineshafts-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMR - Moog's Mineshafts Reimagined</a></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品將有更多變化，並從相似的原始戰利品表中選取，同時也包含模組戰利品，以相容於所有新增戰利品的模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需在伺服器端安裝，不需要所有模組都存在。</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前沒有已知的不相容問題，應可與任何其他模組搭配使用。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p>如果您喜歡這個模組，請考慮支持開發，任何支持都將不勝感激。</p><p>這項開發是無償的業餘活動，因此任何支持都有助於投入更多時間於此。<br>您可以透過 Patreon 支持我，或只是幫忙宣傳。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
